tchabaa willingly sacrifices herself for her brother’s sake hoping to cool Akkee’s anger. However, things don’t always go as planned as Akkee starts developing feelings for Chatchabaa and learns that someone else may be behind Wanisa’s attack. How will his game of vengeance end? Add Synopsis In Portuguese","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.1}],"value":7.1,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":4418,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}